{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bside is a cozy, lightweight life sim where you start by creating your own Biibit: a virtual companion who can live right on your desktop. Bside offers hundreds of customizable options for looks and personality, while your Biibit evolves through interaction, leading to a one-of-a-kind companion just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras/e5e6160fb0134aa6614cfa895132c8dd.avif?t=1763090982\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras_big/e5e6160fb0134aa6614cfa895132c8dd.avif?t=1763090982 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design spaces where you can watch Biibits form friendships through unscripted interaction, or let them live freely on your desktop while you work or play. Bside is not about control. It\u2019s about liberating our players (you) while enabling you to discover your B side through the lives of your Biibit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras/8655a1a85ca65811a665c71afbd536e1.webp?t=1763090982\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras/8655a1a85ca65811a665c71afbd536e1.poster.avif?t=1763090982\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=348 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras/e9e3c52c5aa4eeee7e607b6e4a02e5f0.avif?t=1763090982\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras_big/e9e3c52c5aa4eeee7e607b6e4a02e5f0.avif?t=1763090982 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844350?t=1763090982","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844350?t=1763090982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/63f7b7fdee851bf0027b2cc8d93ace3c70c29d0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763090982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/63f7b7fdee851bf0027b2cc8d93ace3c70c29d0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763090982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bside is a cozy, lightweight life sim where you start by creating your own Biibit: a virtual companion who can live right on your desktop. Bside offers hundreds of customizable options for looks and personality, while your Biibit evolves through interaction, leading to a one-of-a-kind companion just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras/e5e6160fb0134aa6614cfa895132c8dd.avif?t=1763090982\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844350/extras_big/e5e6160fb0134aa6614cfa895132c8dd.avif?t=1763090982 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design spaces where you can watch Biibits form friendships through unscripted interaction, or let them live freely on your desktop while you work or play. Bside is not about control. It\u2019s about liberating our players (you) while enabling you to discover your B side through the lives of your Biibit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app